        "official_en_sha256": "8a8821a5294032cb0c57352a1d108680a236725b2272008637102ae4bd02035b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これまでは危険な魔物が出た時や大きな事件の時は、\r\nレインさんたち飛空艇部隊が駆けつけて\r\n解決してくれていました。",
        "official_en": "You and your airship squadron have always been there to save the day, whether it be an outbreak of dangerous monsters or some other major incident...",
        "real_en": "Rain-san, whenever dangerous monsters appeared or there was a major incident, you and the airship squadron came to our rescue."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
