      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はい。\r\nレインさんたち騎士団のことは\r\n信頼していますので。",
        "official_en": "Thank you, I know you knights will never let us down.",
        "real_en": "Yes, Rain-san. We trust you and the other knights."
      },
