        "official_en_sha256": "beec594f62984d58e9da130c9326a3ecd7844a9e5b55d2038642b95e4051beb0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "スコットには飛空艇部隊を\r\n立ち上げるときに世話になったからな。",
        "official_en": "He’s the guy that helped me out when we first built up the squadron. I owe him a lot.",
        "real_en": "Scott helped me when I was first setting up the airship squadron."
