        "official_en_sha256": "f62980a227420ac90a4309fa4281f57631f8f77bb05494f073cc05c7e7b06331"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レインさん。\r\nこれからグランシェルトは\r\nどうなってしまうのでしょうか。",
        "official_en": "It’s what has made us feel safe. What will Grandshelt do now, Sir Rain?",
        "real_en": "Rain-san, what's going to happen to Grandshelt now?"
