    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_01:SubEv_C01_Rain_01_017:ef642821",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_01",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Rain_01_017",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_01:SubEv_C01_Rain_01_017:ef642821",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_01:SubEv_C01_Rain_01_017:ef642821",
        "jp_sha256": "730c0c43462cde7ba009356e482417185f5bc64b4e4d4b45c9f9ab67fdeae1d2",
        "official_en_sha256": "9f19256224788a8345b9821c3ff0be3a3df085b64ebb91cc5d6dbf66f5f7defd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今度は飛空艇部隊の再建に\r\n力を貸してもらいたいんだ。\r\nまずは今、何ができるかを相談してみる。",
        "official_en": "Figured I could ask him to lend me a hand in rebuilding\nthe squadron. First, though, I need to ask him how we can go about doing it.",
        "real_en": "I'd like his help rebuilding the squadron. First, I'll ask him what we can do right now."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
