      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "少し時間をくれないか。\r\n飛空艇部隊の隊長として対応を考える。",
        "official_en": "I’m the commander of the squadron—<text style=\"italic\">I</> need to fix this. Give me some time to sort everything out.",
        "real_en": "Could you give me a little time? As commander of the airship squadron, I'll work out how to respond."
